A||||4||sdm1964||Greetings from Ft. Polk||||1||
Z||000000||sdm1964||01-19-2001||04:12 PM||||Hey all, I have been on a training exersice at Ft. Polk La. since the 3rd of January. It has been cold and raining for the past 6 days. The sun finally came out today, but going to get cold. Just wanted to let you all know where i have been.  Isn't the new army great, checking e-mail in the field. talk to you all soon.<BR>stephen||||reg||1
Z||000001||Wolfhound||01-19-2001||04:44 PM||||Stay out of Leesville.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>I had AIT there in early 1967. North Fort was called Tigerland then.<P>Off Limits locations were posted on a Wall in our orderly room. To be sure of these places we faithfully made a list before going to town. Being curious as to why they were off limits we had to check them out.<P>Came as close to getting killed in that town as I did in Nam. At the time it was one rough place.||||reg||10
Z||000002||2xsess||01-19-2001||08:55 PM||||Holy Cow!!<P>So, you'll have to tell me all about it, we're leaving on March 14th to head down there.<P>It hit 82 here today.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Too hot.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG">   <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||2birds||01-19-2001||10:28 PM||||Welcome to the New Army.  You guys kill me.<BR>No e-mail for me when I deploy (yet).<P>Had the sunroof out today enjoying the nice warm weather.||||reg||6
Z||000004||2xsess||01-20-2001||12:31 AM||||Well 2birds, I'll let you know the status about email capabilities when I get to Kosovo in May.<P>I didn't get to drive around enough today to take the roof out though, must be nice to be in the Navy. lol<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG">   <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html</A> ||||reg||1
